(This project develops a pipeline for forecasting monthly bilateral trade values at the HS4 product level for South) Tj
T*
(Korea\054 Slovakia and the USA\056 Six methods predict March 2026 across 85\054639 series\072 Naive\054 Seasonal Naive\054) Tj
T*
(exponential smoothing\054 ARIMA\054 XGBoost and LSTM\056 A complementary view adds pretrained Chronos\055Bolt Tiny and) Tj
T*
(compares seven methods across three origins and horizons of one to three months\054 using 99\054298 fixed series\056) Tj
T*
(Further experiments examine real effective exchange rates \050REER\051\054 forecast response around the March 2021 Suez) Tj
T*
(Canal blockage\054 and model complexity\056 Naive achieves the lowest South Korean March sMAPE\054 while ARIMA leads) Tj
T*
(Slovakia and the USA\056 Repeated evaluation favors Naive on overall sMAPE and Chronos on MAE\054 with useful) Tj
T*
(advantages for particular sizes and product chapters\056 REER improves all three metrics for the US LSTM\054 including a) Tj
T*
(14\05678\045 MAE reduction\056 ARIMA has lower pooled post\055event MAE and sMAPE in the historical cohorts\056 Additional) Tj
T*
(capacity and training effort do not consistently improve accuracy\056 These findings refine the proposal\047s expectations\072) Tj
T*
(useful complexity and auxiliary information depend on the forecasting setting and error criterion\056 The reproducible) Tj
